# Web development defaults. Copy to .env.local if needed (never commit keys).
VITE_BASE=/
VITE_API_BASE=/api
# Static offline web: VITE_API_BASE=offline
# Pages: VITE_BASE=/Demo-hearing-loss/ and VITE_API_BASE=offline
# Native commands force / + offline; choose an HTTPS API explicitly in Settings.
# VITE_* values are public in the bundle. LLM_API_KEY belongs only on the backend.
